    "title": "Elijah Family Homes is paving the way by constructing six new cottage homes for families - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Rivera ,\n3 hours ago Kennewick, WA — Elijah Family Homes is expanding a property after buying a home for a family on Gene Street in Kennewick. They plan on building six new cottage homes along with a community center for families that want to host family events, recovery meetings, AA meetings, and so much more. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
